      "text": "(rotor blades whirring)"
    },
    {
      "s": 11.25,
      "e": 12.45,
      "text": "- It was really unbelievable for me."
    },
    {
      "s": 12.45,
      "e": 14.68,
      "text": "We flew down in the National Guard helicopter."
    },
    {
      "s": 14.68,
      "e": 17.1,
      "text": "We saw it from the air, but then to get boots in the ground,"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.1,
      "e": 18.82,
      "text": "and we stopped and visited with the families"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.82,
      "e": 21.02,
      "text": "that were affected, and hearing the stories,"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.98,
      "e": 24.01,
      "text": "it was just very moving."
    },
    {
      "s": 24.01,
      "e": 26.87,
      "text": "And the men and women behind me do a fantastic job"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.87,
      "e": 30.22,
      "text": "of preparedness and providing the help that the folks need."
    },
    {
      "s": 30.22,
      "e": 31.05,
      "text": "It's just so important."
    },
    {
      "s": 31.05,
      "e": 34.05,
      "text": "So as governor of the state, I just wanted to be down here"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.05,
      "e": 38.07,
      "text": "and show my support for the community."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.07,
      "e": 41.61,
      "text": "And we know that one of our greatest assets in Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "s": 41.61,
      "e": 43.77,
      "text": "are our people, and so it's great for me"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.77,
      "e": 45.05,
      "text": "to come down here and see this,"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.05,
      "e": 46.84,
      "text": "and as I travel the other parts of the state"
    },
    {
      "s": 46.84,
      "e": 49.65,
      "text": "and tell the stories about what I'm seeing,"
    },
    {
      "s": 49.65,
      "e": 52.7,
      "text": "it's just fantastic seeing a community come together."
    },
